495
00:27:59.349 --> 00:27:59.989
1.

496
00:28:00.269 --> 00:28:01.677
Context and Problem.

497
00:28:01.957 --> 00:28:09.403
Round-robin plus shallow health checks let one sick pod fail ~40 % of checkouts (§1.1).

498
00:28:09.683 --> 00:28:12.499
Retries were uncontrolled, including on POSTs.

499
00:28:12.779 --> 00:28:19.584
Identity headers could be spoofed by direct calls to services, and rate limiting was per-pod and inconsistent.

500
00:28:19.864 --> 00:28:20.568
2.

501
00:28:20.848 --> 00:28:22.192
