560
00:31:32.556 --> 00:31:33.751
Proposed design.

561
00:31:34.031 --> 00:31:44.697
Edge chain: anycast CDN or WAF, then regional L7 LB (multi-AZ, health-checked gateway pods), then Spring Cloud Gateway (reactive).

562
00:31:44.977 --> 00:32:01.105
Filters: header hygiene, then correlation, then JWT validation, then identity headers, then Redis rate limit, then route, then size limit, then circuit breaker + per-route timeout, then idempotent-only retry (different instance, budget).

563
00:32:01.385 --> 00:32:17.215
Balancing: a custom latency-aware P2C (outstanding times EWMA) with passive outlier ejection (5 consecutive failures, then 30 s, doubling, max 50 % of the pool), zone preference with spill-over, and weighted canary routes.

564
00:32:18.565 --> 00:32:23.066
Services: reachable only from the gateway and the mesh (NetworkPolicy).

565
00:32:23.346 --> 00:32:25.650
