613
00:34:47.683 --> 00:34:52.035
Decision (ADR-032 or 033 summary).

614
00:34:52.315 --> 00:35:01.040
Gateway and service-to-service balancing use latency-aware P2C with passive outlier ejection (max 50 % ejected).

615
00:35:01.320 --> 00:35:06.483
Readiness probes reflect instance-local health, and liveness never checks dependencies.

616
00:35:06.763 --> 00:35:18.197
Retries happen only at the gateway, only for idempotent requests (or POSTs carrying Idempotency-Key), always on a different instance, within a 10 % fleet retry budget.

617
00:35:18.477 --> 00:35:24.771
Every route declares its timeout, and streaming routes declare no response timeout plus an idle timeout.

